        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tetrafluoroethylene film, on glass
Inventory for a chemical.;
CAS number: 009002-84-0; 
Synonyms: Fluon, PTFE, Teflon, Ethene, tetrafluoro-, homopolymer, Politef, Tetrafluoroethylene Resin; 
UUID: 7065b77a-8ee3-3f18-aa39-6f21c21841d0
Gate to gate inventory for the production, estimation for infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chemical processing
Time period: Publication date
Production volume: The worldwide production capacity in 1987 for fluoroplastics was ca. 45 000t.
Sampling: Own assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7065b77a-8ee3-3f18-aa39-6f21c21841d0.xml</text>
